==History ==
2018
*The Giant Snowball [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 20/6/2018, in the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]].
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], added the Giant Snowball to [[Clan Wars]] [[Clan Wars/Clan Wars I|Collection Day]] card pool.
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#October%20Balance%20Changes%20(1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Giant Snowball's slow duration to 2.5 seconds (from 2 seconds) and damage by 10%. It also fixed a bug where [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that were spawned after their parent troops died would be immune to [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] damage.
*On 3/12/2018, a [[Version History#December%20Balance%20Changes%20(3/12/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Giant Snowball’s damage by 14%.
2019
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], decreased the Giant Snowball's area radius to 2.5 tiles (from 3 tiles).
*On 7/10/2019, a [[Version History#Season 4 Balance Changes|Balance Update]], decreased the Giant Snowball's pushback range to 1.5 tiles (from 1.8 tiles).
2020
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Season 14 Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Giant Snowball's [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 30% of the full damage (from 35%).
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], slightly changed the Giant Snowball's description, adding the phrase “''Reduced damage to Crown Towers.''” to it.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the Giant Snowball's pushback range to 1.8 tiles (from 1.5 tiles).
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2023
*On 27/3/2023, the [[Version History#Losers%20Update%20(27/3/2023)|Losers Update]], increased the Giant Snowball's reflect radius to 0.7 tiles (from 0.6 tiles).
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Giant Snowball's slow duration to 3 seconds (from 2.5 seconds), but decreased its damage by 6.7%.
2024
*On 2/12/2024, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/12/2024)|December 2024 Update]], added the Giant Snowball's Evolution.
2025

* On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] decreased the slowdown effect to -30% (from -35%).

2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Giant Snowball's [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 25% of the full damage (from 30%)

