== Trivia==
*The Giant Snowball is 1 of 7 [[cards]] associated with ice, with the others being [[Ice Spirit]], [[Ice Golem]], [[Freeze]], [[Ice Wizard]], [[Super Ice Golem]], and [[Wizard Trio]].
**In the German, Spanish, Dutch, and Portuguese language settings of the game, the Giant Snowball's name translates to "Snowball". In the Arabic and Finnish language settings of the game, the Giant Snowball's name translates to "Giant Snow Globe". In the Chinese and Persian language settings of the game, the Giant Snowball's name translates to "Big Snowball". In the French and Norwegian language settings of the game, the Giant Snowball's name translates to "Mega Snowball" and "Huge Snowball" respectively.
**A Trainer in the [[Training Camp]] is called Trainer Freeze and uses 4 ice-related cards in their [[Battle Decks|deck]], one of them being Giant Snowball, and the others being Ice Spirit, Ice Golem, and Freeze.
*The Giant Snowball is 1 of 3 spells that has been featured in the [[Troop Rush]] game [[:Category:Modes|mode]], the others being [[Royal Delivery]] and [[Clone]].
*Giant Snowball is the only card with "''Giant''" in its name that isn't a [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]].
*Despite the Giant Snowball being large, its shadow on the ground is very small.
*The Giant Snowball was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/Sa0QOSJ5AVY?si=Hlcj6efCnFhxfDYe Clash Royale League 2024 Tournament], by a player called Mohamed Light.
*Before the Giant Snowball's card release, the Giant Snowball's damage was increased by 15%, and its travel speed was increased to 800 (from 700).

